WEBVTT

00:02:28.847 --> 00:02:31.926
So if you think about that and you say,

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:35.658
"American printing of money
and the borrowing

00:02:35.682 --> 00:02:38.200
will leave us with a lot of debt
and monetization,"

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:40.237
that's something interesting
to talk about,

00:02:40.261 --> 00:02:41.889
and we need to talk about that.

00:02:41.913 --> 00:02:43.667
Who will pay these bills,

00:02:43.691 --> 00:02:45.031
and how will that be shared,

00:02:45.055 --> 00:02:46.966
will be something we need to talk about.

00:02:46.990 --> 00:02:49.450
But you will know
that you will get that money.

00:02:49.474 --> 00:02:53.306
And the Europeans will get
their versions of that money.

00:02:53.616 --> 00:02:55.974
But we are in a new world.

00:02:55.998 --> 00:03:00.266
And that world is most similar
to the 1930-45 world,